<p>While the origins of the dwarves remain clouded in mystery to the other races, it is obvious that they share strong ties to the stone.</p><p>You can target any wall and immediately enter it, appearing on the other side.</p><p>This can pass through up to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Constitution 100">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> tiles (increases with Constitution and talent level).</p>